      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p02337",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“那孩子虽然其貌不扬，但很能干。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "That boy may not look like much, but he is very capable.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p02337",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "我决无意强求。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I have absolutely no intention of forcing the matter.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p02337",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "但有朝一日有幸得到千重子小姐的垂青，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "But if one day he should be fortunate enough to win Miss Chieko's favor,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p02337",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "真到那份上，恕我冒昧，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "if it truly came to that, forgive my boldness,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p02337",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "请你把他收为养老女婿。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "please take him in as a son-in-law who would carry on the household.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p02337",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "我愿把他过继……”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I would be willing to give him up for adoption...\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p02337",
      "unit_index": 7,
      "source_text": "水木说着，低下了头。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Mizuki said this and lowered his head.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
